"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T08:11:55-07:00","id":99174,"title":"","content":"Can you fold them one handed? Or with a prosthetic body? Are these ghost in the shell references doing anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T09:36:51-07:00","id":99236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SirPants</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/91448-in-case-you-missed-the-anouncement-about-the-progress-of-the-demon-books?p=99010#post99010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want the translation guide damn it! How many origami cranes do I need to fold to make it come out yesterday?</div> </div> </div> </div>I started seriously writing the DTG last week. The first section I'm writing is the <i>Fallen </i>-&gt; <i>Descent </i>conversion. That's a big job, because there are over a hundred powers to convert, plus mechanics like Torment. I'm honestly not sure how long that's going to take. <br /> <br /> Torment should be fun. The nWoD implementation isn't an Integrity trait, so you can use it alongside Cover if you want.<br /> <br /> If I can find the time to work with public feedback, I may blog some of the systems in progress.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/