ass=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I started seriously writing the DTG last week. The first section I'm writing is the <i>Fallen </i>-&gt; <i>Descent </i>conversion. That's a big job, because there are over a hundred powers to convert, plus mechanics like Torment. I'm honestly not sure how long that's going to take.<br /> <br /> Torment should be fun. The nWoD implementation isn't an Integrity trait, so you can use it alongside Cover if you want.<br /> <br /> If I can find the time to work with public feedback, I may blog some of the systems in progress.</div> </div> </div> </div>The part about torment sounds interesting <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> especially the part about it being able to be used alongside cover","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}